Subject: [PATCH v5 1/2] virtio: clean up features qword/dword terms
Message-ID: <ad53b7b6be87fc524f45abaeca0bb05fb3633397.1763535083.git.mst@redhat.com>
References: <cover.1763535083.git.mst@redhat.com>
